13
00:00:36,030 --> 00:00:37,630
(Howard:)It wasn't that bad.

14
00:00:37,632 --> 00:00:39,232
(Leonard:)Read it back one more time.

15
00:00:39,233 --> 00:00:40,733
(clears throat)

16
00:00:40,735 --> 00:00:44,375
"My good sir, we are neither
crackpots nor wannabes.

17
00:00:44,372 --> 00:00:47,272
"In fact, we are
experts in our fields.

18
00:00:47,275 --> 00:00:49,575
"And while you hide
behind your anonymity,

19
00:00:49,577 --> 00:00:51,577
"we stand behind our paper.

20
00:00:51,579 --> 00:00:53,879
And later tonight, your mother."

21
00:00:57,385 --> 00:00:59,455
(Leonard:)And you don't think
that's too rough?

